# Federating Atlantis

This instance follows the Atlantis method (Proteus). Atlantis owns the method, the `atl_v0` ontology, `atlantis_core`,
the templates and the board. This instance owns its data and its rulings. The terms are
`Atlantis.aDNA/how/campaigns/campaign_atlantis_genesis/artifacts/instance_contract_v0.md` (v0.2.0).

```yaml
federation_ref:
  source_vault: Atlantis.aDNA
  source_persona: Proteus
  source_path: what/atlantis_core/
  source_commit: {{atlantis_commit}}               # pinned at fork; bumped deliberately
  version: "0.2.0"
  version_policy: minor
  patterns_used: [ATL-ONTOLOGY, ATL-STREAM, ATL-VITALS, ATL-LABEL, ATL-EVAL, ATL-EXPLAIN, ATL-BOARD]
  conformance: atlantis_instance
  instance:
    patient: {unit_kind: {{unit_kind}}, external_id: "{{region_external_id}}", time_step: {{time_step}}}
    event:   {variable: "{{event_variable}}", threshold: {{event_threshold}}, unit: "{{event_unit}}", direction: {{event_direction}}, horizon: "{{event_horizon}} weeks"}
    streams: [{{stream_list}}]
    data_posture: {class: {{posture_class}}, ruling: "{{posture_adr_path}}"}
    self_test: "python -m atlantis_core.selftest --instance ."   # green BEFORE any real data is fetched (the fetch CLI enforces it)
    board_entry: "what/board/entries/<date>_{{instance_slug}}_v<n>.json"   # metrics only; copied to Atlantis by memo
```

## The order of work (fork skill, `Atlantis.aDNA/how/skills/skill_atlantis_instance_fork.md`)

```
A=<Atlantis.aDNA>/what/atlantis_core
$A/.venv/bin/python -m atlantis_core.mapping --check mapping.yaml
$A/.venv/bin/python -m atlantis_core.conform  --instance . --stage declared
$A/.venv/bin/python -m atlantis_core.selftest --instance .          # writes the receipt
# ratify the posture ADR, then and only then:
$A/.venv/bin/python -m atlantis_core.fetch    --instance .          # refuses without the receipt
$A/.venv/bin/python -m atlantis_core.conform  --instance . --stage fetched
```

**Escalation:** a change that would need `atlantis_core` edited from inside this instance → stop, and send a template change
to Atlantis as a memo (`Atlantis.aDNA/who/coordination/inbox/`). Do not patch locally.
